    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird abstract puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 well-designed levels that will make you think. Takes around 40 minutes to beat it to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels using the\u00a0<strong>Level Editor!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your creations in form of <strong>PNG images\u00a0</strong>and share it with your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like this: <i>(this is a level encoded in to a PNG that you can play if you load it in the game!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389980/extras/a8b23c41ea4d93f39299b8321df731c0.webp?t=1752902179\" width=720 height=42 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play countless user-generated levels. Visit the Subreddit (/r/recursiongame) to find cool levels to play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent updates with new content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack brimming with personality... and darkness.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one person.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game timer to speedrun levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More free updates are planned after release 1.0:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD 2</strong> (4 new colors and mechanics, more official levels. Up to 2 hours of official content instead of half an hour)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun updates for the Level Editor. (Musical note blocks so you can write your own melodies, Undo/Redo buttons, and more!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The PNG saving/loading feature is not compatible with Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming soon so wishlist it if you are interested! :D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The price will be $2.99</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you found this game on Steam, you can try the original newgrounds experience for free, just search &quot;recursion newgrounds game&quot; on the internet, I can't post the link because Steam doesn't allow it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird abstract puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 well-designed levels that will make you think. Takes around 40 minutes to beat it to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels using the\u00a0<strong>Level Editor!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your creations in form of <strong>PNG images\u00a0</strong>and share it with your friends!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like this: <i>(this is a level encoded in to a PNG that you can play if you load it in the game!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389980/extras/a8b23c41ea4d93f39299b8321df731c0.webp?t=1752902179\" width=720 height=42 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play countless user-generated levels. Visit the Subreddit (/r/recursiongame) to find cool levels to play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent updates with new content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack brimming with personality... and darkness.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created by one person.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-Game timer to speedrun levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More free updates are planned after release 1.0:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD 2</strong> (4 new colors and mechanics, more official levels. Up to 2 hours of official content instead of half an hour)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun updates for the Level Editor. (Musical note blocks so you can write your own melodies, Undo/Redo buttons, and more!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The PNG saving/loading feature is not compatible with Steam Deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming soon so wishlist it if you are interested! :D</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The price will be $2.99</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you found this game on Steam, you can try the original newgrounds experience for free, just search &quot;recursion newgrounds game&quot; on the internet, I can't post the link because Steam doesn't allow it.</p>",
